        "text": "<thinking> To implement the batch_translate.py file, I need to use a concrete external provider for translation services. I will use the Amazon Translate service, which is a neural machine translation service provided by AWS. The AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) will be used to interact with the Amazon Translate API. The code will import the necessary Boto3 module and use the Amazon Translate client to translate a list of strings while preserving their order. </thinking>\n",
